@startuml
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center

box "Data Provider"
participant "Submission Client" as SubmitClient
participant "Submission File Server" as SubmitFiles
end box

box "Data Consumer"
participant "Submission Server" as SubmitServer
participant "File Retrieval Client" as RetrievalClient
participant "Status File Server" as StatusFiles
end box

SubmitClient -> SubmitServer: Submit first manifest URL (submissionStatus: in-progress)
SubmitServer --> SubmitClient: Success OperationOutcome

RetrievalClient -> SubmitFiles: Retrieve manifest file
SubmitFiles --> RetrievalClient
RetrievalClient -> SubmitFiles: Retrieve submission bulk data files
SubmitFiles --> RetrievalClient

SubmitClient -> SubmitServer: Status kick-off
SubmitServer --> SubmitClient: Polling URL

SubmitClient -> SubmitServer: Poll request
SubmitServer --> SubmitClient: Partial status manifest

SubmitClient -> StatusFiles: Retrieve status files
StatusFiles --> SubmitClient

SubmitClient -> SubmitServer: Submit second manifest URL (submissionStatus: completed)
SubmitServer --> SubmitClient: Success OperationOutcome

RetrievalClient -> SubmitFiles: Retrieve manifest file
SubmitFiles --> RetrievalClient
RetrievalClient -> SubmitFiles: Retrieve submission bulk data files
SubmitFiles --> RetrievalClient

SubmitClient -> SubmitServer: Poll request
SubmitServer --> SubmitClient: Complete status manifest

SubmitClient -> StatusFiles: Retrieve final status files
StatusFiles --> SubmitClient
@enduml
